<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>출결 인증 필요</title>
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
</head>
<body class="bg-[#f5f5f5] min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center font-sans antialiased py-10">

    <div class="bg-white p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-xl shadow-[0_4px_12px_rgba(0,0,0,0.08)] max-w-md w-full mx-4 border border-gray-100">
        
        <div class="flex justify-center mb-5">
            <div class="bg-red-50 p-4 rounded-full">
                <svg class="w-10 h-10 text-red-500" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                    <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 9v2m0 4h.01m-6.938 4h13.856c1.54 0 2.502-1.667 1.732-3L13.732 4c-.77-1.333-2.694-1.333-3.464 0L3.34 16c-.77 1.333.192 3 1.732 3z"></path>
                </svg>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="text-center mb-6">
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-800 tracking-tight">출결 인증 필요</h2>
            <p id="current-date-banner" class="text-sm text-gray-500 font-medium mt-2 tracking-wider"><%=education_info.edu_date%></p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-gray-50 border border-gray-200 rounded-lg p-5 mb-8 text-center shadow-inner">
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
                현재 <strong class="text-red-600 font-semibold">당일 출결 내역</strong>이 없습니다.<br>
                하단 버튼을 눌러 스캔을 먼저 진행해주세요.
            </p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="pt-2 border-t border-gray-100">
            <button class="w-full py-3.5 px-4 bg-[#1976d2] hover:bg-[#1565c0] text-white font-semibold text-sm rounded-md shadow-[0_2px_4px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)] hover:shadow-[0_4px_8px_rgba(0,0,0,0.2)] transition-all duration-200 ease-in-out uppercase tracking-wider focus:outline-none flex items-center justify-center gap-2" onclick="moveToScanPage()">
                <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                    <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M3 4a1 1 0 011-1h4a1 1 0 010 2H5v2a1 1 0 01-2 0V4zm0 16a1 1 0 001 1h4a1 1 0 000-2H5v-2a1 1 0 00-2 0v4zm16-16a1 1 0 00-1-1h-4a1 1 0 000 2h2v2a1 1 0 002 0V4zm0 16a1 1 0 01-1 1h-4a1 1 0 010-2h2v-2a1 1 0 012 0v4zM12 8v4l3 3"></path>
                </svg>
                QR 스캔 화면으로 이동
            </button>
        </div>

    </div>

    <script>
        // 1. 브라우저 네이티브 경고창 (필요시 주석 해제)
        alert('출결 내역이 없습니다. QR 스캔을 먼저 진행해주세요.');
        // 3. 페이지 이동 함수
        function moveToScanPage() {
            window.location.href = "/qr_scan"; 
        }
    </script>
</body>
</html>